  "solution": "**Logic : (2nd number + 3rd number) × 2 = 1st number**\n\nGiven :\n\n__\n \n• (240, 55, 65)\n\n​(**55 + 65**__) × 2 = 240\n\n__**120 × 2**__ = 240\n\n240 = 240 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• (320, 85, 75)\n\n​(**85 + 75**__) × 2 = 320\n\n__**160 × 2**__ = 320\n\n320 = 320 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : (140, 35, 25)\n\n​(**35 + 25**__) × 2 = 140\n\n__**60 × 2**__ = 140\n\n120 ≠ 140 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : (220, 90, 15)\n\n​(90 + 15) × 2 = 220\n\n105 × 2 = 220\n\n210 ≠ 220 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n \n• Option - (3) : (160, 35, 45)\n\n​(35 + 45__) × 2 = 160\n\n__80 × 2__ = 160\n\n**160 = 160 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : (200, 5, 105)​\n\n​(5 + 105__) × 2 = 200\n\n__110 × 2__ = 200\n\n220 ≠ 200 **(LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\nHence, **\"Option - (3)\"** is the correct answer.\n\n222:T1431,\n&",
